            "review": "<p>My fianc? and I chose ELCC for faith-based pre-marital counseling. We had an incredible experience. It helped strengthen our communication, we learned practical biblical tools for resolving conflict and grew closer to each other and to God. We feel more confident and prepared for a strong, Christ-centered marriage. We highly recommend ELCC to any couple looking to build a solid foundation for their future together.</p>",
